>> hex := Chimiro nyowani: ['%x'].

# write 10
Zvabuda nyora: Hx xA, mutsara-mutsva.

# make it easy to write numbers as hex
Nhamba kana-zvasvika: ['as-hex'] ita: { <- hex shandisa-nhamba-izere: pachako.
}.

# write
Zvabuda nyora: Hx xA as-hex, mutsara-mutsva.
Zvabuda nyora: Hx xFF as-hex, mutsara-mutsva.